Description: Lightweight System, Docker, Compose & Swarm monitor (TUI & GUI)
 A fast and intuitive terminal (TUI) and GTK3 desktop utility to monitor
 host CPU, RAM, disk, network, Docker containers, Compose projects,
 and Swarm clusters.
